OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FDrivers in the Thames Valley are
OL,7,Ffacing some of the highest fuel
OL,8,Fprices, as diesel on some forecourts
OL,9,Ftop #2 a litre.
OL,11,FPrices have been rising since the Iran
OL,12,Fwar began at the end of February.
OL,14,FSome drivers have told ITV News
OL,15,FMeridian that they're having to reduce
OL,16,Fthe amount of journeys they make
OL,17,Fbecause they simply can't afford it.
OL,19,FDiesel has risen to 205.9p a litre at
OL,20,FMembury services in Berkshire while
OL,21,Funleaded has hit 185p a litre.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
