FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FThe Government says it's frozen fuel
OL,7,Fduty to help meanwhile motoring groups
OL,8,Fsay the best advice is to shop around.
OL,10,FRAC head of policy Simon Williams
OL,11,Fsaid: "Fuel prices continued to rise
OL,12,Fover the weekend with petrol climbing
OL,13,Fto a new Iran War high of 160.85p and
OL,14,Fdiesel going back over 180p, something
OL,15,Fdrivers haven't seen since 9 June.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
