OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,F"Unleaded has now risen more than 10p
OL,7,Fa litre ` 7% ` since bottoming out at
OL,8,F150.59p on 6 July while diesel is up
OL,9,F16p (15.8p) a litre, or 10%, almost
OL,10,Ffully reversing June's 16.6p reduction
OL,11,Fwhich was the biggest monthly drop on
OL,12,Frecord.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
