OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,F"Positively for petrol car drivers,
OL,7,FRAC analysis of wholesale fuel data
OL,8,Fshows prices at the pump should begin
OL,9,Fto stabilise this week. But the news
OL,10,Ffor those who rely on diesel,
OL,11,Fincluding many businesses, is worrying
OL,12,Fas it looks set to carry on rising,
OL,13,Fpossibly reaching 185p in the next
OL,14,Fweek or so."
OL,16,FThe increase in the cost of fuel comes
OL,17,Fas more than 20 million UK drivers are
OL,18,Fexpected to embark on journeys this
OL,19,Fweek amid the summer holiday season.
OL,26,@vD@LO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
