OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FThe AA is urging people to "beat the
OL,7,Fhigher prices" by using price
OL,8,Fcomparison apps powered by the
OL,9,FGovernment's Fuel Finder service.
OL,11,FThe higher prices have led to record
OL,12,Flevels of forecourt drive-offs.
OL,14,FFuel theft prevention company
OL,15,FForecourt Eye said incidents of fuel
OL,16,Ftaken without payment soared by 20% in
OL,17,Fthe five months after the conflict
OL,18,Fbegan on February 28, compared with
OL,19,Fthe preceding five months.
OL,26,@nD@\OUoD@NO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
