OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FThe increase in pump prices driven by
OL,7,Fthe war means the value of stolen fuel
OL,8,Frose by 48% over the same period,
OL,9,Freaching an estimated daily average of
OL,10,F#194,000 across the UK's 8,359
OL,11,Fforecourts.
OL,13,FGordon Balmer, executive director of
OL,14,Fthe Petrol Retailers Association,
OL,15,Fwhich represents independent
OL,16,Fforecourts, said its members are
OL,17,F"reporting increasing levels of abuse
OL,18,Fand aggression towards colleagues who
OL,19,Fare simply doing their jobs and have
OL,20,Fno influence over the price displayed
OL,21,Fon the forecourt".
OL,26,@yD@AOU}D@QO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
