OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FBen Lawrence, a director at Lawrences
OL,7,FGarages, which owns five petrol
OL,8,Fstations situated in Norfolk and
OL,9,FHampshire, said fuel thefts were
OL,10,Fhistorically often carried out by
OL,11,Fpeople involved in other crimes, but
OL,12,Frises in the cost of living mean this
OL,13,Fis no longer the case.
OL,15,FHe added there is a "misconception"
OL,16,Fthat all forecourts featuring branding
OL,17,Ffrom energy giants such as BP and
OL,18,FShell are operated by those companies,
OL,19,Frather than smaller businesses, so
OL,20,Fsome drivers believe it "doesn't
OL,21,Fmatter" when they fail to pay.
OL,26,@wD@UOUwD@cO]|D@YOU}D@GO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/9
