OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1785937683
OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,F"It does matter to us," he said.
OL,8,F"When someone drives off (after taking
OL,9,Ffuel worth) #80-#90, it's hitting us,
OL,10,Fnot the oil companies.
OL,12,F"We've already purchased it."
OL,14,FThe Government's planned September
OL,15,F2026 increase to fuel duty has been
OL,16,Fdelayed until the end of the year as a
OL,17,Fresult of increasing prices at the
OL,18,Fpumps.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@WO]pD@AOUtD@AOUtD@]O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
