OL,3,CDrivers in the Thames Valley face some
OL,4,Cof the highest fuel prices
OL,6,FOriginally introduced by the
OL,7,FConservatives in 2022 following
OL,8,FRussia's invasion of Ukraine, the 5p
OL,9,Freduction was due to end in September
OL,10,F2026.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/9
